{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"球面"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"球面"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>归纳定义</h3>\n<p>$n=-1$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$(-1)$ 维球面 $S^{-1}$ 是空集 (始对象).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>$n\\geq 0$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$n$ 维球面 $S^n$ 是如下的"},{"Local":{"url":"推出","text":"推出"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\n\\begin{array}\n{ccc}\nS^{n-1} &amp; \\to &amp; * \\\n\\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>&amp; \\to &amp; S^{n}.\n\\end{array}\n$$</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n"}]}}